Z||000000||p4n1c||01-05-2001||02:10 PM||||Can anyone tell me if it would be feasible or possible to create an angled piece(ala Dodge Stealth) from the top of the radio down to touch the raised part of the center console?  <P>I want to use a single DIN head unit(I know I can just use an adaptor, but I want to make a custom center console) and remodel the center console.  Is there anything in the way that I should be aware of, that would make it so the unit didn't fit?  <P>Am I right in assuming a 3-4" gap between the center dash and the automatic shifter?<P>Hope someone can shed some light for me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-=-<BR>-=[ Come out swingin' ]=-||||reg||5
