Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||01-05-2001||03:34 PM||||It wouldn't be my first choice of design either, but it's one awesome looking dash.. very well done. I just don't like the gauges in the middle.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Anyway, when you're ready to work on this, give me a call.. it'll be good practice for my own custom dash.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||14
